ill ok\">Seguro</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Totodile\" data-l=\"260\"><td>Totodile</td><td class=\"r\">260</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#5d84cf\"><i></i>Água</span></td><td class=\"r\">×2,5</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">640</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:3.091641685341001%;background:var(--ok)\"></span><i></i></span> 5%</td><td><span class=\"pill ok\">Seguro</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Marill\" data-l=\"260\"><td>Marill</td><td class=\"r\">260</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#5d84cf\"><i></i>Água</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d996aa\"><i></i>Fada</span></td><td class=\"r\">×2,5</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">560</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:5.036863389412086%;background:var(--ok)\"></span><i></i></span> 8%</td><td><span class=\"pill ok\">Seguro</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Tyrogue\" data-l=\"290\"><td>Tyrogue</td><td class=\"r\">290</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#b0483f\"><i></i>Lutador</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">360</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:2.0318682349583526%;background:var(--ok)\"></span><i></i></span> 3%</td><td><span class=\"pill ok\">Seguro</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Smoochum\" data-l=\"290\"><td>Smoochum</td><td class=\"r\">290</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#7fc2c2\"><i></i>Gelo</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d06688\"><i></i>Psíquico</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">320</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:2.5351258089698328%;background:var(--ok)\"></span><i></i></span> 4%</td><td><span class=\"pill ok\">Seguro</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    "bosses": {
      "html": "<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>Boss</th><th>Nv</th><th>Bate</th><th>Apanha</th><th>Dano / HP do boss</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Moltres</td><td>300</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×1</td><td>91,1%</td></tr><tr><td>Zapdos</td><td>300</td><td>×1</td><td>×0.333</td><td>89,2%</td></tr><tr><td>Articuno</td><td>300</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×1</td><td>87,6%</td></tr><tr><td>Suicune</td><td>650</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×1</td><td>69,4%</td></tr><tr><td>Yveltal</td><td>44050</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×1</td><td>59,2%</td></tr><tr><td>Kyogre</td><td>3100</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×1</td><td>51,7%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">Os 6 bosses em que este exemplar entrega mais dano proporcional ao HP estimado, no nível exigido pelo boss. Considera equipe de 5 nesse nível. HP e golpes do boss são estimados pela espécie; confira a equipe completa na aba Equipes.</p>"
    },
    "build": {
      "html": "<div class=\"partner\"><b>Gyarados</b><span>Hunt Nv 100</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#5d84cf\"><i></i>Água</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a8fd6\"><i></i>Voador</span> &nbsp;Aguenta Terra. Bate forte em Planta, Terra.</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Brave Steelix</b><span>Hunt Nv 150 na Outland</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9ea3b3\"><i></i>Metálico</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#c4a663\"><i></i>Terra</span> &nbsp;Bate forte em Elétrico.</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Clefable</b><span>Hunt Nv 80</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d996aa\"><i></i>Fada</span> &nbsp;Bate forte em Dragão.</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Arcanine</b><span>Hunt Nv 100</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d9774a\"><i></i>Fogo</span> &nbsp;Reforço de stats (BST 555).</div></div><p class=\"note\">Ele sofre de Terra; 1 desses tipos ficam cobertos. A escolha é por tipo e BST. Simule cada parceiro selecionando ele na busca.</p>"
